        "change_type": "row_content_changed",
        "column": "Description, Highlights, and Frequency",
        "old": "This daily report provides reconciliation information to issuers for the currency conversion fees and optional issuer fees for incoming transactions. Transactions are summarized by clearing currency, business transaction, and jurisdiction. This report provides conversion fees by clearing currency. The interchange amounts are shown in both settlement currency and clearing currency. The optional issuer fee is shown in clearing currency (if applicable).",
        "new": "This daily report provides reconciliation information to issuers for the currency conversion fees and Visa Issuer FX Calculator amounts for incoming transactions. Transactions are summarized by clearing currency, business transaction, and jurisdiction. This report provides conversion fees by clearing currency. The interchange amounts are shown in both settlement currency and clearing currency. The Visa Issuer FX Calculator amount is shown in clearing currency (if applicable).",
        "similarity_ratio": 0.891,
        "table_title": "Available VSS Reports",
        "key": "vss-210 – currency conversion fees report"
